WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:01,970
Lin Moshi

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:03,370
Take a walk with me

3
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:04,850
Senior Sister Lin wants to see you

4
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:07,460
Senior Sister Lin Lin Wan'er

5
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:15,350
I’ve seen Senior Sister Lin come and sit here

6
00:00:18,590 --> 00:00:21,600
It’s good to break through to the third-rate level in just one year.

7
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:24,790
Far inferior to my senior sister

8
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:27,880
We are from the same village

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,400
It sounds like they are from the same hometown.

10
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:31,040
When I was in the village

11
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,040
I've seen you several times

12
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:34,210
Senior sister has a good memory

13
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:35,970
Now I enter the inner door

14
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:37,370
Become a disciple of the great master

15
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:39,410
You're doing well in the outer sect too.

16
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:41,890
What are your plans for the future?

17
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:44,130
This is to coopt me

18
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:45,450
What's the plan?

19
00:00:45,770 --> 00:00:47,770
Practice hard and try to get into the inner gate.

20
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:51,310
After entering the inner door?

21
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:53,130
Haven't thought that far yet

22
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:54,370
You are in time

23
00:00:54,730 --> 00:00:56,010
This is a bottle of Qi Gathering List

24
00:00:56,210 --> 00:00:57,490
Good for third-rate dancers

25
00:00:57,650 --> 00:00:59,090
Take it back and practice hard

26
00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:01,170
Three years later, there will be a big deal at the outer gate

27
00:01:01,330 --> 00:01:02,610
The top three can enter the inner gate

28
00:01:02,850 --> 00:01:05,130
I hope you can be in the top three

29
00:01:05,610 --> 00:01:07,010
I entered the sect of a big boss

30
00:01:07,410 --> 00:01:09,530
We will also need some manpower at the inner door in the future.

31
00:01:09,850 --> 00:01:10,810
You are my fellow countryman

32
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:13,050
If you can enter the inner gate, follow me

33
00:01:13,330 --> 00:01:14,490
Your benefits are indispensable

34
00:01:14,810 --> 00:01:15,770
Thank you for the promotion, sister

35
00:01:15,970 --> 00:01:17,050
But there will be a shortfall of money in the future

36
00:01:17,570 --> 00:01:18,530
Go back to practice

37
00:01:18,970 --> 00:01:23,670
Waiting for your good news in three years before I die

38
00:01:23,990 --> 00:01:25,310
The last face I saw

39
00:01:25,590 --> 00:01:26,750
It's this face

40
00:01:32,410 --> 00:01:33,610
Second-rate top strength

41
00:01:33,970 --> 00:01:34,890
And I am only third-rate

42
00:01:34,970 --> 00:01:36,080
Too far apart

43
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:37,680
I still need to continue to undergo abdominal surgery

44
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:41,280
I only have three days to lie.
